# Pull request target

- Open pull requests on `4GeeksAcademy/company-repo-melvin-ai-2` with base `main`.
- `origin` is already `https://github.com/4GeeksAcademy/company-repo-melvin-ai-2.git`. Push with `git push -u origin HEAD`.
- Do not open or push a pull request to `Mewell9/milestone-0`.
- Do not add another remote for submission.

```bash
git push -u origin HEAD
gh pr create --repo 4GeeksAcademy/company-repo-melvin-ai-2 --base main
```
